// The window's view: app.contract's `provide` and `view`, moved unchanged (20261008-app-contract-room) so
// the root keeps its lines for state, resources and actions (X9). Each root name the view reads is a
// prop of the same name; `pending(providerAuthChanged)` is `providerAuthPending`. A feature that shows
// a new root value adds its prop here and `name=name` to app.contract's `T3Window(...)`. The use lines
// keep app.contract's order: the plan orders shapes by first use.
